1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
Aviation media covers every crash.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
You hear about the one that failed.

3
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,500
You do not hear about the 99.999 percent that did not.

4
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,000
It has almost nothing to say about the flights that go right.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,000
Every investigation produces findings.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,000
The findings become recommendations.

7
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,000
The recommendations get adopted.

8
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,500
The next generation of aircraft and procedures is safer.

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,800
Down from 0.83 in fiscal year 2017.

10
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:20,300
Fiscal year 2024 saw the lowest rate on record: 0.68 fatal accidents per 100,000 flight hours.

